            <ArticleTitle>Diverse approaches to asthma DM succeed in Medicaid populations.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>71-7, 65</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Diverse approaches to asthma CM can produce results in Medicaid populations. It's one of the toughest groups to manage, but health care organizations willing to reach out to all eligible candidates and target specific barriers to care are making solid headway. And, as the experiences of two organizations illustrate, there is more than one route to success.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
